ked of anyone, and nothing else you can do meanwhile: chat_state \"waiting\" with seconds, your estimate of how long until it does, and for, what you wait for. Waiting on a person is need_human.\n> - Otherwise: continue the work.","attachments":[],"quotes":[],"createdAt":1792674427422,"time":{"createdAt":{"at":1792674427422,"ago":"刚刚","full":"10/22 21:07:07","until":"1 分钟内","past":true}}},"read":0,"unread":2,"people":[{"id":"alice@example.test","name":"Name of alice","email":"alice@example.test","via":"cloud","shown":{"name":"Name of alice","display":"你","picture":"https://example.test/p.png","mine":true}}],"firstText":"端到端测试的对话 post:你好，我是测试用的 agent","time":{"createdAt":{"at":1792674424993,"ago":"刚刚","full":"10/22 21:07:04","until":"1 分钟内","past":true}}},"title":"端到端测试的对话 post:你好，我是测试用的 agent","people":[{"id":"alice@example.test","name":"Name of alice","email":"alice@example.test","via":"cloud","shown":{"name":"Name of alice","display":"你","picture":"https://example.test/p.png","mine":true}}],"agents":[{"session":{"key":"ember:c-eac355c9dc","connect":"ember","scope":"all","createdBy":"alice@example.test","boundTo":[],"creator":{"id":"alice@example.test","name":"Name of alice","email":"alice@example.test","via":"cloud"},"participants":[{"id":"alice@example.test","name":"Name of alice","email":"alice@example.test","via":"cloud"}],"runtime":"claude","profile":"cc","profilePinned":false,"runtimeSessionId":"c687b58b-e0eb-4385-b9b7-34ba834eb108","contextActions":["compact","clear"],"workspace":"/tmp/mbe2e-C/data/sessions/ember/c-eac355c9dc/workspace","running":false,"createdAt":1792674424992,"lastActiveAt":1792674427421,"process":"warm","turns":4,"pending":0,"firstText":"端到端测试的对话 post:你好，我是测试用的 agent","lastTurn":{"id":"49e6bd18-728d-418e-9a27-700d882ab899","kind":"nudge","outcome":"completed","startedAt":1792674427420,"endedAt":1792674427421},"statusText":"出错：意外停止","tone":"red","mark":"failed","badgeText":"失败，需要处理","titleText":"端到端测试的对话 post:你好，我是测试用的 agent","agentText":"